            },
            {
                "entry_id": "5af49eba-dfed-30d3-b033-78ee5aff2fd9",
                "word": "faire-valoir",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "64ee46e2-5d47-3639-b12c-be680664c8c8",
                        "entry_id": "5af49eba-dfed-30d3-b033-78ee5aff2fd9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Personnage destiné à mettre en valeur les qualités du personnage principal."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "91951429-377b-465f-aa95-72e8bf203a5e",
                                "sense_id": "64ee46e2-5d47-3639-b12c-be680664c8c8",
                                "text": "Selon lui, M. Mussolini n’a pas vocation à être le faire-valoir de M. Hitler !"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5f28edc6-d88b-47dd-ba45-7c16e6afeb93",
                                "sense_id": "64ee46e2-5d47-3639-b12c-be680664c8c8",
                                "text": "Il avait été humilié devant tous ses potes, et il devait absolument rétablir sa réputation. Et cette larve sanguinolente, là, devant lui, allait lui servir de faire-valoir."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "873f15e0-8327-308c-bf60-75aa3a48d64b",
                        "entry_id": "5af49eba-dfed-30d3-b033-78ee5aff2fd9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Tout ce qui permet de mettre en valeur un ensemble, une composition, etc."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "broadly",
                            "figuratively"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6483933e-e9e7-419e-b72c-dd1cfdf9e618",
                                "sense_id": "873f15e0-8327-308c-bf60-75aa3a48d64b",
                                "text": "Les végétaux à feuillage persistant et à rameaux colorés, bases solides, jouent les faire-valoir, mettant aussi en vedette les plantes poussant au ras du sol."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "852f052e-add3-4234-b769-a2912fab0181",
                        "source_entry_id": "5af49eba-dfed-30d3-b033-78ee5aff2fd9",
                        "target_lang_word": "sidekick",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "sidekick",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cb22e217-0547-3394-95c3-6309dcc1cd4f",
                                        "entry_id": "aa025c5d-c948-34de-baef-dbb74a7a7759",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An assistant to another person, especially to a superior or more important person."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "61775138-63ec-4d35-8986-8db5a33f7d1c",
                                                "sense_id": "cb22e217-0547-3394-95c3-6309dcc1cd4f",
                                                "text": "In the abstract, Stuhlbarg’s twinkly-eyed sidekick suggests Joe Pesci in Lethal Weapon 2 by way of late-period Robin Williams with an alien twist, but Stuhlbarg makes a character that easily could have come across as precious into a surprisingly palatable, even charming man."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b849c9e0-19d8-4c04-a76c-d0cf49c3f7e5",
                                                "sense_id": "cb22e217-0547-3394-95c3-6309dcc1cd4f",
                                                "text": "If representation and recruitment is an objective, self-styled mavericks like Kelly and his Queensland sidekick George Christensen have some utility."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8c6c93fc-9a40-410f-ad3f-36ec8c5cdc2e",
                                                "sense_id": "cb22e217-0547-3394-95c3-6309dcc1cd4f",
                                                "text": "Elon Musk, Mr. Trump’s new sidekick, shared on his social media platform X an NBC News video of Pennsylvania Democratic Sen. John Fetterman, who suggested the Gaetz pick was a strategic move to upset Democrats."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "20967074-a03e-3b9e-a25f-edbc78e3c845",
                                        "entry_id": "aa025c5d-c948-34de-baef-dbb74a7a7759",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In literature, theatre, etc., a good foil of the protagonist, a character who helps emphasize the traits of the main character."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "340cae20-5c0c-4c6c-858e-6cb2ace9a679",
                                                "sense_id": "20967074-a03e-3b9e-a25f-edbc78e3c845",
                                                "text": "So even though he had – no question – the best lines in Friends, he was never what he would have been in an earlier era: the sidekick."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c4ef20c9-081b-4bff-b082-8f6d392af9df",
                        "source_entry_id": "5af49eba-dfed-30d3-b033-78ee5aff2fd9",
                        "target_lang_word": "foil",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "foil",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8d7d1405-88e9-3f4f-b1cd-6b54960889da",
                                        "entry_id": "bc807b43-62f7-33a0-92c8-cec64fec0e13",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The track of an animal."
                                        ],
